  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The CORRECT statement(s) for cubic close packed (ccp) three dimensional structure is (are)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QhmtV",
      "text": "The number of the nearest neighbours of an atom present in the topmost layer is 12",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hpoDq",
      "text": "The efficiency of atom packing is  <math><mn>74</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zR351",
      "text": "The number of octahedral and tetrahedral voids per atom are 1 and 2, respectively",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2S2Qh",
      "text": "The unit cell edge length is <math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math> times the radius of the atom",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "CCP is ABC ABC ..... type packing<br />A] In topmost layer, each atom is in contact with 6 atoms in same layer and 3 atoms below this layer.<br />B] Packing fraction <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.74</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />C] Each FCC unit has effective no of atoms = 4<br />Octahedral void = 4<br />Tetrahedral void = 8<br />D] <math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
    "image": null
  },
